flowchart TD
    Start([Launch main.py / run.sh]) --> InitLog[Initialize Logging: logs/activity.log]
    InitLog --> MenuDisplay[/Display OS RESOURCE MANAGEMENT Menu/]

    MenuDisplay --> ChoiceInput[/User inputs choice: 1 - 6/]
    ChoiceInput --> ValChoice{Valid choice 1-6?}

    ValChoice -- No --> ErrMsg[Log Warning & Print Invalid Choice] --> MenuDisplay
    ValChoice -- Yes: 6 --> Terminate[Log Shutdown & Exit Program] --> EndNode([Shutdown])

    ValChoice -- Yes: 1 --> SubCPU[run_cpu_module]
    ValChoice -- Yes: 2 --> SubMEM[run_memory_module]
    ValChoice -- Yes: 3 --> SubDLK[run_deadlock_module]
    ValChoice -- Yes: 4 --> SubDSK[run_disk_module]
    ValChoice -- Yes: 5 --> SubREP[run_reporting_module]

    subgraph ModuleExecution[Common Module Sub-Workflow]
        SelectSource{Input Source?}
        SelectSource -- Interactive Console --> PromptInputs[/Read Parameters from CLI/]
        SelectSource -- CSV File Batch --> ReadCSV[/Load from data/*.csv/]

        PromptInputs --> ValidateInputs{Validate Inputs<br/>via utils/validators}
        ReadCSV --> ValidateInputs

        ValidateInputs -- Invalid --> Reprompt[Display Error Diagnostics & Retry] --> SelectSource
        ValidateInputs -- Valid --> ExecAlgo[Execute Selected Algorithm]
        ExecAlgo --> CompMetrics[Compute Formulas & Metrics]
        CompMetrics --> RenderOutput[/Display Tabular Results & Gantt Chart/]
        RenderOutput --> LogExec[Log Module Execution to activity.log]
    end

    SubCPU --> SelectSource
    SubMEM --> SelectSource
    SubDLK --> SelectSource
    SubDSK --> SelectSource
    SubREP --> SelectSource

    LogExec --> RetMenu[/Press Enter to Return to Menu/] --> MenuDisplay
